    {
      "id": "b2ba5b24569d-q1",
      "number": 1,
      "question": "Select the correct combination of mathematical signs to replace the * signs and to balance the given equation. 17*4*63*7*21*3*59",
      "questionHtml": "<p><span style=\"\">Select the correct combination of mathematical signs to replace the * signs and to balance the given equation.</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">17*4*63*7*21*3*59</span></p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "&times;, +, &divide;, -, +, =",
          "html": "<span style=\"\">&times;, +,&nbsp;&divide;, -,&nbsp;+, =</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "=, -, &times;, +, -, &divide;",
          "html": "=, -, &times;, +, -, &divide;"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "-, &times;, +, =, &divide;, -",
          "html": "-, &times;, +, =, &divide;, -"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "=, -, &times;, +, &divide;, -",
          "html": "<span style=\"\">=, -, &times;, +,&nbsp;&divide;, -</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p>By using BODMAS and going by the options</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage27401.png\" style=\"height: 180px; width: 320px;\" /></p>\n\n<p><strong>Given Equation :-&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"\">17*4*63*7*21*3*59</span></strong></p>\n\n<p>Interchanging * with signs</p>\n\n<p><strong>Option (1)&nbsp;<span style=\"\">&times;, +,&nbsp;&divide;, -,&nbsp;+, =</span></strong></p>\n\n<p>&rArr;<span style=\"\">&nbsp;17 &times; 4 + <u><strong>63 &divide; 7</strong></u> - 21 + 3 = 59</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; <u><strong>17&nbsp;&times; 4</strong></u> + 9 - 21 + 3 = 59&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; <strong>68 + 9</strong> - 21<strong> + 3</strong> = 59</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; 80 - 21&nbsp;= 59&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"\">&rArr; 59 = 59&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;LHS =&nbsp;RHS</span></strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>Option(2)&nbsp;<span style=\"\">=, -, &times;, +, -, &divide;</span></strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;&nbsp;17 =&nbsp;4 -&nbsp;63 &times;&nbsp; 7 +&nbsp;21 -&nbsp;3 &divide;&nbsp; 59</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; 17 = 4 - 63&nbsp;&times; 7 + 21 - 0.0508</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; 17 = 4 - 441 + 21 - 0.0508</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; 17 = 25 - 441 - 0.0508</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; 17 = - 416.0508</span></p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;LHS &ne; RHS&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"\">Option(3)&nbsp;&nbsp;-, &times;, +, =, &divide;, -</span></strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;&nbsp;17 -&nbsp;4 &times;&nbsp; 63 +&nbsp; 7 =&nbsp;21 &divide; 3 -&nbsp;59</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp; 17 - 4&nbsp;&times; 63 + 7 = 7 -59</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp; 17 - 252 + 7 = - 52</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp; -252 + 24 = - 52</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; - 228 = - 52</span></p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;LHS &ne; RHS&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"\">Option(4)&nbsp;&nbsp;=, -, &times;, +,&nbsp;&divide;, -</span></strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;&nbsp;17 =&nbsp;4 -&nbsp;63 &times;&nbsp; 7 +&nbsp;21 &divide;&nbsp; 3 -&nbsp;59</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; 17 = 4 - 63&nbsp;&times; 7 + 7 - 59</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; 17 = 4 - 441 + 7 - 59</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; 17 = 11 - 441 - 59</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; 17 = 11 - 500</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; 17 = - 489</span></p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp; LHS &ne; RHS&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">Therefore, only option(1)</span>&nbsp;satisfies the above equation.</p>\n\n<p>Hence, the correct answer is<strong> option(1)</strong></p>\n",
      "images": [
        "//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage27401.png"
      ],
