          "text": "3, 6",
          "html": "<span style=\"\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">3, 6</font></font></span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "Option 3): 3 × 10 ÷ 6 + 7 - 2 = 10 → 3 × 1.66 + 7 - 2 = 10<br />\n→ 5.0 + 7 - 2 = 10 → 12 - 2 = 10 → 10 = 10",
