      "question": "If &times; means +, &divide; means -, + means &times;, - means &divide;, what will come in place of the question mark (?) in the given expression? 182 - 13 &times; 5 + 16 &divide; 44 = ?",
      "questionHtml": "<p>If&nbsp;&times; means +, &divide; means -, + means &times;, - means &divide;, what will come in place of the question mark (?) in the given expression?</p>\n\n<p>182 -&nbsp;13 &times; 5 + 16 &divide; 44 =&nbsp;?</p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "50",
          "html": "<span style=\"\">50</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "62",
          "html": "<span style=\"\">62</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "86",
          "html": "<span style=\"\">86</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "48",
          "html": "<span style=\"\">48</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p>After interchanging the signs, we get: 182 ÷ 13 + 5 × 16 - 44 </p>\n\n<p>→ 14 + 5 × 16 - 44 → 14 + 80 - 44 → 94 - 44 = 50</p>\n",
