    {
      "id": "b2ba5b24569d-q4",
      "number": 4,
      "question": "If P denotes &lsquo; subtraction &rsquo;, M denotes &lsquo; division &rsquo;, R denotes &lsquo; addition &rsquo;, and W denotes &lsquo; multiplication &rsquo;, then what will be the value of the following expression? 112 M (6 R 8) W 9 P 15 W 3 R (28 M (12 P 5))",
      "questionHtml": "<p style=\"\">If P&nbsp;denotes &lsquo;<span style=\"\">subtraction</span>&rsquo;, M&nbsp;denotes &lsquo;<span style=\"\">division</span>&rsquo;, R&nbsp;denotes &lsquo;<span style=\"\">addition</span>&rsquo;, and W&nbsp;denotes &lsquo;<span style=\"\">multiplication</span>&rsquo;, then what will be the value of the following expression?</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">112 M (6 R 8) W 9 P 15 W 3 R (28 M (12 P 5))</p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "46",
          "html": "46"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "59",
          "html": "59"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "31",
          "html": "31"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "29",
          "html": "29"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>The logic followed here is :-</p>\n\n<p>By using BODMAS RULE :</p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/06/6275d787e881e062e294fa7f_16547874172121.png\" style=\"height: 166px; width: 300px;\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">P</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;denotes &lsquo;</span><span style=\"\">subtraction</span><span style=\"\">&rsquo;, M</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;denotes &lsquo;</span><span style=\"\">division</span><span style=\"\">&rsquo;, R</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;denotes &lsquo;</span><span style=\"\">addition</span><span style=\"\">&rsquo;, and W</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;denotes &lsquo;</span><span style=\"\">multiplication</span><span style=\"\">&rsquo;,</span></p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\" width: 200px;\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Alphabet</span></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">P</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">M</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">R</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">W</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Symbol</span></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">-</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&divide;&nbsp;</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">+</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&times;&nbsp;</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p style=\"\">Given equation :&nbsp;<span style=\"\">112 M (6 R 8) W 9 P 15 W 3 R (28 M (12 P 5))</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">After inserting the symbols in given equation the equation is as follows : 112&nbsp;&divide; (6 + 8)&nbsp;&times; 9 - 15&nbsp;&times; 3 + (28 &divide; (12 - 5))</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">=&nbsp;<span style=\"\">112&nbsp;&divide; <u><strong>(6 + 8)</strong></u>&nbsp;&times; 9 - 15&nbsp;&times; 3 + (28 &divide; <u><strong>(12 - 5)</strong></u>)</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">=&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">112&nbsp;&divide; 14 &times; 9 - 15&nbsp;&times; 3 + <u><strong>(28 &divide; 7)</strong></u></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">=&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\"><u><strong>112&nbsp;&divide; 14</strong></u> &times; 9 - 15&nbsp;&times; 3 + 4</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">=&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\"><u><strong>8 &times; 9</strong></u> - <u><strong>15&nbsp;&times; 3</strong></u> + 4</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">=&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\"><u><strong>72</strong></u> - 45 <u><strong>+ 4</strong></u></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">=&nbsp;</span><u><strong><span style=\"\">76&nbsp;- 45</span></strong></u></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><strong><span style=\"\">= 31</span></strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">Hence, the correct answer is <strong>&quot;31&quot;.</strong></span></p>\n",
      "images": [
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/06/6275d787e881e062e294fa7f_16547874172121.png"
      ],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
