      "question": "What will come in the place of '?' in the following equation, if '+' and '-' are interchanged and '&times;' and '&divide;' are interchanged? 63 &divide; 3 + 14 &times; 7 - 16 = ?",
      "questionHtml": "<p>What will come in the place of &#39;?&#39; in the following equation, if&nbsp;&#39;+&#39; and &#39;-&#39; are interchanged and &#39;&times;&#39; and &#39;&divide;&#39; are interchanged?</p>\n\n<p>63 &divide; 3 + 14 &times; 7 - 16 = ?</p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "113",
          "html": "113"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "103",
          "html": "103"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "203",
          "html": "203&nbsp;"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "213",
          "html": "213"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">BODMAS Table:&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage14137.png\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Given equation:&nbsp;63 &divide; 3 + 14 &times; 7 - 16 = ?</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Now,&nbsp;if &lsquo;+&rsquo; and &lsquo;-&lsquo;&nbsp;and &lsquo;&times;&#39; and &#39;&divide;&rsquo; are interchanged, then:</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr;&nbsp;63 <span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&times;</span>&nbsp;3 -&nbsp;<u><strong>14 <span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&divide;</span> 7</strong></u> +&nbsp;16 = ?</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr;&nbsp;<u><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">63&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&times;</span></strong></u><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><u><strong>&nbsp;3</strong></u> -</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;</span>2<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;+</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;16 = ?</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr;&nbsp;<u style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">189</span></u><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;-</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">2</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;<u><strong>+</strong></u></span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><u><strong>&nbsp;16</strong></u> = ?</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr;&nbsp;<u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">205</span><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">&nbsp;- 2</span></u>&nbsp;=<strong> 203.</strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Hence, the correct answer is&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">&quot;Option 3&quot;</span>.</p>\n",
      "images": [
        "//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage14137.png"
      ],
