    {
      "id": "b2ba5b24569d-q6",
      "number": 6,
      "question": "Which two signs need to be interchanged to make the given equation correct? 20 &divide; 10 &times; 100 &minus; 10 + 100 = 110",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Which two signs need to be interchanged to make the given equation correct?</p>\n20 &divide; 10 &times; 100 &minus; 10 + 100 = 110",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "+ and &divide;",
          "html": "+ and &divide;&nbsp;"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "&times; and -",
          "html": "&times; and -"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "&divide; and &times;",
          "html": "&divide; and &times;&nbsp;"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "+ and -",
          "html": "+ and -"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p>1) + and &divide;</p>\n\n<p>Given expression: 20 &divide; 10 &times; 100 &minus; 10 + 100 = 910</p>\n\n<p>After replacing the symbols, we get:</p>\n\n<p>L.H.S = 20 + 10 &times; 100 - 10 &divide; 100</p>\n\n<p>= 20 + 10 &times; 100 - 1 &divide; 10</p>\n\n<p>= 20 + 1000 - 1 &divide; 10</p>\n\n<p>= 20 + 999.9</p>\n\n<p>= 1019.9 &ne; R.H.S</p>\n\n<p>2) &times; and -</p>\n\n<p>Given expression: 20 &divide; 10 &times; 100 &minus; 10 + 100 = 910</p>\n\n<p>After replacing the symbols, we get:</p>\n\n<p>L.H.S = 20 &divide; 10 - 100 &times; 10 + 100</p>\n\n<p>= 2 - 1000 + 100</p>\n\n<p>= - 998 + 100</p>\n\n<p>= - 898 &ne; R.H.S</p>\n\n<p>3) &divide; and &times;</p>\n\n<p>Given expression: 20 &divide; 10 &times; 100 &minus; 10 + 100 = 910</p>\n\n<p>After replacing the symbols, we get:</p>\n\n<p>L.H.S = 20 &times; 10 &divide; 100 &minus; 10 + 100 = 910</p>\n\n<p>= 20 &times; 10 &divide; 100 &minus; 10 + 100</p>\n\n<p>= 20 &times; 1 &divide; 10 &minus; 10 + 100</p>\n\n<p>= 2 - 10 + 100</p>\n\n<p>= 92 &ne; RHS</p>\n\n<p>4) + and -</p>\n\n<p>Given expression: 20 &divide; 10 &times; 100 &minus; 10 + 100 = 910</p>\n\n<p>After replacing the symbols, we get:</p>\n\n<p>LHS = 20 &divide; 10 &times; 100 + 10 - 100 = 110</p>\n\n<p>= 2 &times; 100 + 10 - 100</p>\n\n<p>= 200 + 10 - 100</p>\n\n<p>= 110 = RHS</p>\n\n<p>Hence, &lsquo;+ and -&rsquo; is the correct answer.</p>\nNOTE: The question has been modified as it was erroneous.",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "b2ba5b24569d-q7",
