      "question": "If 'A' denotes 'addition', 'B' denotes 'multiplication', 'C' denotes 'subtraction' and 'D' denotes 'division', then what will be the value of the following expression? 625 D 5 A 93 C 22 B 8",
      "questionHtml": "<p>If &#39;A&#39; denotes &#39;addition&#39;, &#39;B&#39; denotes &#39;multiplication&#39;, &#39;C&#39; denotes &#39;subtraction&#39; and &#39;D&#39; denotes &#39;division&#39;, then what will be the value of the following expression?</p>\n\n<p>625 D 5 A 93 C 22 B 8</p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "24",
          "html": "24"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "26",
          "html": "26"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "42",
          "html": "42"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "62",
          "html": "62"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p style=\"\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https:https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/04/BODMAS.png\" style=\"width: 290px; height: 159px;\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">According to the question,</p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 59px; height: 17px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>Letter</b></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 38px; height: 17px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>A</b></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 38px; height: 17px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>B</b></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 38px; height: 17px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>C</b></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 38px; height: 17px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>D</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 59px; height: 18px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Meaning</span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 38px; height: 18px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">+</span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 38px; height: 18px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">&times;</span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 38px; height: 18px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>-</b></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 38px; height: 18px;\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; text-align: center; \">&divide;</span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p style=\"\">Given that:&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"\">625 D 5 A 93 C 22 B 8</span></strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">After replacing the letters&nbsp;with their meanings, we get :-</p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">=&nbsp;</span><u><strong><span style=\"\">625 </span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; text-align: center; \">&divide;</span></strong></u><span style=\"\"><u><strong>&nbsp;5</strong></u> +&nbsp;93 -&nbsp;22 &times;&nbsp;8</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">= 125 + 93 - <u><strong>22&nbsp;&times; 8</strong></u></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">= <u><strong>125 + 93</strong></u> - 176</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">= <u><strong>218 - 176</strong></u></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">= <strong>42</strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">Hence, <strong>&quot;42&quot;</strong> is the correct answer.</p>\n",
