      "question": "By interchanging the given two signs, which of the following equations will NOT be correct? &times; and &ndash; I. 17 &ndash; 21 + 86 &divide; 2 &times; 13 = 387 II. 10 + 63 &ndash; 12 &times; 259 &divide; 7 = 739",
      "questionHtml": "<p>By interchanging the given two signs, which of the following equations will NOT be correct?</p>\n\n<p>&times; and &ndash;</p>\n\n<p>I. 17 &ndash; 21 + 86 &divide; 2 &times; 13 = 387</p>\n\n<p>II. 10 + 63 &ndash; 12 &times; 259 &divide; 7 = 739</p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Equation I",
          "html": "Equation I"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Equation II",
          "html": "Equation II"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Neither I nor II",
          "html": "Neither I nor II"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Both I and II",
          "html": "Both I and II"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p style=\"\">BODMAS Table:&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage14137.png\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">Given equation&nbsp;I:&nbsp;<span style=\"\">17 &ndash; 21 + 86 &divide; 2 &times; 13 = 387</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">Now,&nbsp;if &#39;<span style=\"\">&times; and &ndash;</span>&#39;&nbsp;are interchanged, then:</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;<span style=\"\">17 &times;&nbsp;21 + <u><strong>86 &divide; 2</strong></u> -&nbsp;13 = 387</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;<span style=\"\"><u><strong>17 &times; 21</strong></u> + 43 - 13 = 387</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;<span style=\"\"><u><strong>357 + 43</strong></u>&nbsp;- 13 = 387</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;<u><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">400&nbsp;- 13</span></u>&nbsp;= 387</p>\n\n<p>=&nbsp;387&nbsp;= 387.</p>\n\n<p>LHS = RHS.</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">Given equation&nbsp;II:&nbsp;<span style=\"\">10 + 63 &ndash; 12 &times; 259 &divide; 7 = 739</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">Now,&nbsp;if &#39;<span style=\"\">&times; and &ndash;</span>&#39;&nbsp;are interchanged, then:</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;<span style=\"\">10 + 63 &times;&nbsp;12 -&nbsp;<u><strong>259 &divide; 7</strong></u> = 739</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;<span style=\"\">10 + <u><strong>63&nbsp;</strong></u></span><u><strong><span style=\"\">&times;</span></strong></u><span style=\"\"><u><strong>&nbsp;12</strong></u> -</span>&nbsp;37<span style=\"\">&nbsp;= 739</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;<span style=\"\"><u><strong>10 + 756</strong></u> - 37 = 739</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">&rArr; <u><strong>766 - 37</strong></u><span style=\"\">&nbsp;= 739</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">=&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">729&nbsp;</span><strong>&ne;</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"> 739</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">LHS &ne;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">&nbsp;RHS.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">Here, Equation&nbsp;II&nbsp;are the&nbsp;incorrect after interchanging the given symbol.</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">Hence, the correct answer is&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">&quot;Option 2&quot;</span>.</p>\n",
